# -*- coding: utf-8 -*-
"""
MeetingAI - Web-first, single-file real-time meeting assistant.

The distributed file is self-extracting: on first start it creates its web UI,
prompts, configuration, data folders, helper batch files, and test script next
to itself. Browser microphone audio is cut into self-contained media blobs and uploaded with ordinary HTTPS/HTTP POST requests. The server never opens a local microphone and the browser UI uses lightweight HTTP polling instead of WebSocket for realtime updates. ASR engines are optional and loaded lazily.

Python 3.10+ is required.
"""
